<title>INDIA: India Himachal Futuristic 1st half net up.</title>
<headline>India Himachal Futuristic 1st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     154.33 vs 126.38</p>
<p>    Net sales		857.71 vs 532.23</p>
<p>    Other income	  104.62  vs   60.39</p>
<p>    Expenditure	   613.78  vs  356.89</p>
<p>    Interest		 95.35  vs   12.77</p>
<p>    Gross profit	  177.36  vs  143.84</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   23.03  vs   12.46</p>
<p>    Tax			  nil  vs    5.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Himachal Futuristic Communications Ltd released the half-yearly results in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
